Third-party data (files in data/):

The CT volume and segmentations are derived from case s0591 of the
TotalSegmentator dataset v2.0.1 (University Hospital Basel), licensed under
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source: https://zenodo.org/records/10047263
Changes: resampled orientation, cropped to the body, outside-body voxels set
to air, segmentation fragments removed, masks merged into one label map.
Cite: Wasserthal J. et al. TotalSegmentator: Robust Segmentation of 104
Anatomic Structures in CT Images. Radiology: Artificial Intelligence, 2023.
The MIT licence above applies to the code only, not to this data.
